4. Grant of licence
4.1 Subject to the terms of this licence, we grant you a personal, non-exclusive,
non-transferable and free-of-charge licence, which we may end only as section 7
provides, to use the connector for as long as you hold a MarketAI account with at least
one bot.
4.2 Under this licence you may:
(a) download the connector and keep copies of it for your own use;
(b) run it on your own computer or on a server you rent;
(c) use it to follow the bots of your own MarketAI account through MarketAI's service;
(d) use it to trade exchange accounts that you own, or that are owned by a company on
    whose behalf you are authorised to trade.
4.3 A third party may install and configure the connector for you, provided that the
connector trades only your accounts, and only on your behalf. You remain responsible
for everything done on your behalf under this licence.
4.4 You may use the connector only if you are at least 18 years old, and only if
neither you nor any person on whose behalf you use it is subject to restrictive
measures (sanctions) adopted by the European Union or the United Nations.

5. Restrictions
Unless we have given you our prior written permission, you may not:
(a) sell, rent, lend or sublicense the connector, or charge anyone for running it;
(b) run it on behalf of another person, or use it to trade assets that belong to other
    people, such as clients' accounts or a vault holding other people's deposits,
    except as sections 4.2(d) and 4.3 allow;
(c) distribute or publish copies of the connector, modified or not;
(d) use it with any source of signals other than MarketAI's service;
(e) modify, adapt or translate it, or incorporate its source code, in whole or in part,
    into other software.
That you can see the source code in the image does not make it open source, and gives
you no right to reuse it.

6. Rights under mandatory law
Nothing in this licence restricts the rights that the law grants to every lawful user
